<p>HD Radio&trade;</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td width="623" valign="top">
<p>Auto-dimming rear-view mirror</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td width="623" valign="top">
<p>HomeLink&reg;</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td width="623" valign="top">
<p>SPORT driving mode (CVT only)</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td width="623" valign="top">
<p>Rain-sensing wipers</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td width="623" valign="top">
<p>Door mirror with integrated LED turn signal</p>
</td>
</tr>
</tbody>
</table>
